     "titulo": "Dialogue: checking a news story",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "看到关于「表达观点与阅读说明文」的消息，你会先核实什么？",
       "alumno": "When reading news about «expressing opinions and reading informative texts», what would you check first?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我们可以先做一个简单的计划。",
       "alumno": "We can start with a simple plan.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "要是中间出了问题怎么办？",
       "alumno": "What if a problem comes up along the way?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "到时候再调整，先把眼前的事情做好。",
       "alumno": "We'll adjust later; first let's do well what's in front of us.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: checking a news story",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "关于「表达观点与阅读说明文」的消息传播很快，但传播速度不等于准确。",
       "alumno": "News about «expressing opinions and reading informative texts» can spread quickly, but speed doesn't mean accuracy.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "判断消息是否可靠时，应核实原始来源，并比较独立报道。",
       "alumno": "To judge whether a report is reliable, check the original source and compare independent coverage.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "如果条件发生变化，原来的决定也可以重新考虑。",
       "alumno": "If circumstances change, the original decision can also be reconsidered.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
